1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,216
Only two adults are needed to replace the parents.

2
00:00:03,216 --> 00:00:09,778
In nature, predators, drying ponds and disease cut the forty three down to about two.

3
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:20,703
External fertilisation with no parental care only works if the number of eggs is enormous, the opposite of the mammal strategy of a few, well protected young.

